# Nested folder
npm create vite@latest my-app -- --template react

#Directly in the folder root
npm create vite@latest . -- --template react


#Expoting compononets
- Default Export: There can only be one Default per file
==== Sytax =====
(a) export Default compononetName (at the end of the file)
(b) export Default function cp() {}


- Named Export: There can be multiple named export
==== Sytax =====
(a) export (compononetName) (at the end of the file)
(b) export function compononetName() {}
